  <div>
    <p class="lead">Your introduction shouldn’t depend on a signal.</p>
    <p>
      Many smart cards open an online profile. Cardistry takes a different route: your
      contact information lives directly on the NFC chip, with the option to encode it in
      a printed QR too.
    </p>
    <p>
      On a compatible phone, your details can be read without fetching a web page. Less
      friction between “nice to meet you” and “let’s stay in touch”.
    </p>
